    "Lines":  {
                  "intro":  {
                                "Text":  "Name\u0027s Brock Malone. Folks call me Anvil, on account of what happens when things hit me. I used to run security on the old transit line, before the tunnels went bad. Something big has been nesting at the bottom of this hole, and I\u0027m not walking out of here until it\u0027s dead.",
                                "Replies":  [
                                                "job"
                                            ]
                            },
                  "job":  {
                              "Text":  "Abmouth Supremus. Big, ugly, all mouth, and it eats the scavengers who wander too deep. I can\u0027t take it alone, and from the look of you, neither can you. Bring it down with me and you\u0027ll be paid well, and I\u0027ll answer your call anywhere on Rubi-Ka after. Until then, I only fight down here.",
                              "Replies":  [
                                              "deal"
                                          ]
                          },
                  "deal":  {
                               "Text":  "Good. I\u0027ll take the hits, you do the damage. Kill Abmouth Supremus. {givequest MSUB}{dungeonmerc enforcer_subway}",
